What I am explicitly not doing
- Not changing the queue cap of eight.
- Not changing the 1/2/3-second randomized Retry-After.
- Not changing the four-per-pod or two-per-tenant active limits.
- Not changing cancellation semantics (queued work removed, active work kept).
